      "Normal brain MRI or mild nonspecific findings"
    ],
    "genetic": [
      "Molecular confirmation of maternal uniparental disomy of chromosome 6 by microsatellite or SNP array analysis",
      "Absence of paternal allele on chromosome 6"
    ],
